{"id":"21545eb20080c3e0","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-self-dual.md","title":"相对于 many-one 归约的自对偶集合","display":"df-self-dual — 相对于 many-one 归约的自对偶集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-self-dual","aliases":["20-df-self-dual"],"display":"df-self-dual — 相对于 many-one 归约的自对偶集合","chapter":"2","section":"2.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Exercise 2.2.10","source_printed_pages":[33],"source_pdf_pages":[69],"depends_on":["[[20-df-mred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-self-dual"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-self-dual</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-self-dual — 相对于 many-one 归约的自对偶集合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.2.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>33</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>69</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SelfDual}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_m\\omega\\setminus A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SelfDual}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_m\\omega\\setminus A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一见证经取补也给逆向，故自对偶集合与补集具有相同 m 度。该定义没有把数值变换无固定点与函数外延无固定点混用。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.2.10；印刷页 33；PDF 第 69 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SelfDual}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_m\\omega\\setminus A.","display":true}],"bytes":1001,"backlinks":[{"id":"f718fe4d6ccbe5e9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-self-dual]]；see [[20-thm-recursion]]。"}],"outgoing":["d5dada982b721c80"]}